{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15112430","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15112430","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1511243001:0":{"text":"こ、こんなはずでは……","source_cn":"你……你居然……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03C03984DEF53F6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511243002:0":{"text":"ウチに負けるなんて思わなかったって？","source_cn":"没想到我能打败你？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EF6E9AA7FDD1481","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511243003:0":{"text":"自分の年齢まで忘れちまったかい？今のアンタが、若者の動きについてこれるはずないだろ。","source_cn":"你老了，老得连自己的年岁都忘记。你的动作早就跟不上年轻人了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C3E0F5331B979D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1511243004:0":{"text":"さて、ゴーダンに勝ったんだ。掟通り、これでウチが新しい首領ってことになるよな？","source_cn":"喂，按照传统，打赢了戈丹，我就是下一任首领，没错吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA74125BC182EA6E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1511243005:0":{"text":"うっ……そうだ。","source_cn":"呃……是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D68940ADB5C10E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1511243006:0":{"text":"それは残念、<style=\"highlight\">ウチは首領になんて興味ない</style>んだ。根っこから腐りきって、皮しか残ってないスッカスカな一族の長なんてまっぴらごめんだね。","source_cn":"但是真遗憾，<style=highlight>我不想当...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97BEAB580AA032D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1511243007:0":{"text":"ゴーダンを殺すつもりはないよ。このまま生き恥を晒して、時間と共に腐った木もろとも風化しちまえばいいさ。","source_cn":"我不会处决戈丹，让他活着，继续被时间风化磨碎吧，直到变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EE485D751C7A382","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1511243008:0":{"text":"ウチは、ヤクボルを抜ける。","source_cn":"而我，我要离开雅库伯尔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE46D97BA41219F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1511243009:0":{"text":"ティラヤ！？","source_cn":"缇洛亚？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6E0FE634F02C176","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1511243010:1":{"text":"ここを出て、理想郷を――<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>の言う、<style=\"highlight\">ユグドラシル</style>を探しに行く。","source_cn":"我要离开这里，去传说中的理想乡，去<style=str...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3A65469DC0E62537","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ここを出て、理想郷を――<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>の言う、<style=\"highlight\">ユグドラシル</style>を探しに行く。","female":"ここを出て、理想郷を――<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>の言う、<style=\"highlight\">ユグドラシル</style>を探しに行く。","variant_male_record_index":"189987","variant_female_record_index":"189988","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1511243011:0":{"text":"タンビの言うとおりだよ。どんなに遠くたって、方角さえ合っていれば、いつか必ず辿り着けるさ。","source_cn":"椴尾说得对，不论多远，只要方向正确，总有一天能走到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDECA7D81E90005C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1511243012:0":{"text":"身の程知らずが……！領地の外に出てみろ、たちまち獣に引き裂かれるぞ……！","source_cn":"不自量力……！雅库伯尔外的野兽会将你撕碎……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE40CD960BD38DD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1511243013:0":{"text":"負けた奴が、減らず口をたたくんじゃないよ。","source_cn":"手下败将，还嘴硬什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00FDA82F244741BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1511243014:0":{"text":"さあ、ウチと一緒にユグドラシルを目指したい奴は、ついてきな！","source_cn":"——来吧。想一起去薄暮丛林的人，就跟我来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07D50F306939EAEF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:戈丹":{"text":"ゴーダン","source":"戈丹","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:缇洛亚":{"text":"ティラヤ","source":"缇洛亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:树怒山谷的战士":{"text":"樹怒の谷の戦士","source":"树